  "contract": [
    "Real atoms must resolve to a registered chemical atom type; low-level type_idx padding semantics remain unchanged.",
    "Used LJLK types must have finite lj_radius, lj_wdepth, lk_dgfree, lk_lambda and lk_volume in float32.",
    "Unknown types and missing/non-finite parameters raise ValueError with residue/atom/type/field context before native scoring.",
    "Unused incomplete LJLK rows, finite zero virtual rows and the low-level None/NaN sentinel remain allowed.",
    "Packed LJLK annotation keys include the scoring database so previous valid setup cannot conceal changed coverage.",
    "Packed atom-type setup reuses validated chemical-source block annotations and heavy-atom indices."
  ],
